      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To be honest, based on what I’ve observed, it might not be possible to reproduce this issue with absolute certainty. However, it occurs with a fairly high probability whenever I move the menu around. Roughly speaking, the “World” tab disappears about once every three times.\n\nAs for the looping in the “Social” tab, while the probability is low, I’ve definitely experienced it multiple times.\n\nSo, if the menu’s movement could be optimized a bit more, the experience should be much smoother.",
